\s1 The Distress of Zion
\q1 \v 1 \w How|strong="H00349"\w*\f + \fr 4:1 \ft This chapter is an acrostic poem, each verse beginning with the successive letters of the Hebrew alphabet.\f* \w the gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w has become tarnished|strong="H06004"\w*,
